---
import ResearchFigureFrame from './ResearchFigureFrame.astro';
---

<ResearchFigureFrame
  className="project-memory-routing"
  figureNumber="03"
  title="Route, then narrow"
  caption="The current workflow is explicit and human-authored. AGENTS.md routes an agent toward relevant durable memory; the repository does not detect relevance automatically."
>
  <div class="routing-flow">
    <section><span class="label">Task</span><strong>Change publication behavior</strong><p>The task supplies scope, not every document in the repository.</p></section>
    <div class="flow-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <section class="router"><span class="label">Routing layer</span><code>AGENTS.md</code><p>Read the constitution, then the relevant spec, plan/tasks, and ADRs before structural changes.</p></section>
    <div class="flow-marker" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <section class="selected"><span class="label">Selected context</span><ol><li><span>01</span>Project-wide factual guardrails</li><li><span>02</span>Publication-gating specification and decisions</li><li><span>03</span>Relevant implementation surfaces</li></ol></section>
  </div>
</ResearchFigureFrame>

<style>
  :global(.research-reading .research-prose figure.project-memory-routing) { border-radius:0 !important; }
  .routing-flow { display:grid; gap:.8rem; }
  section { min-width:0; }
  .label, code, li span { font-family:var(--font-mono-ui); }
  .label { display:block; color:var(--text-muted); font-size:.6875rem; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }
  section > strong, code { display:block; margin-top:.35rem; color:var(--text-primary); font-size:1rem; line-height:1.4; }
  code { border:0 !important; background:transparent !important; padding:0 !important; color:var(--accent) !important; font-size:.875rem; }
  section p { margin:.45rem 0 0 !important; color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:.875rem; line-height:1.6; }
  .flow-marker { align-self:center; justify-self:center; color:var(--accent); font-family:var(--font-mono-ui); transform:rotate(90deg); }
  .selected { border-left:2px solid var(--accent); padding-left:1rem; }
  ol { display:grid; gap:.5rem; margin:.65rem 0 0; padding:0; list-style:none; }
  li { margin:0 !important; color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:.875rem; line-height:1.5; }
  li span { display:inline-block; min-width:1.8rem; color:var(--accent); font-size:.6875rem; }
  @media (min-width:820px) { .routing-flow { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 2rem minmax(0,1.1fr) 2rem minmax(0,1.15fr); align-items:center; } .flow-marker { transform:none; } }
</style>
